OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers in murder arrest after
OL,4,Aunexplained death
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after the death of
OL,8,Fan 81-year-old man on Christmas Day.
OL,10,FGodfrey Bradford's body was found at a
OL,11,Frural property north of Chudleigh at
OL,12,F10:50 GMT on 25 December 2025, where a
OL,13,Ffire was believed to have occurred.
OL,15,FDetectives investigating the case
OL,16,Farrested an 18-year-old man and a
OL,17,F19-year-old woman on suspicion of
OL,18,Fmurder on Tuesday, Devon and Cornwall
OL,19,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
